The global Party Supplies Market is supported by demand for decorative products, themed accessories, balloons, banners, disposable tableware, party games, and other items used for personal and professional celebrations. Birthdays, weddings, holiday gatherings, corporate functions, and community events create recurring demand. Personalization, themed decorations, online shopping, and interest in more environmentally conscious products are influencing the market's development.
